<title>PAKISTAN: Glaxo Wellcome Pakistan half-yr net dips.</title>
<headline>Glaxo Wellcome Pakistan half-yr net dips.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended</p>
<p>December 31, 1996 (in million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		 1,605 vs 1,603</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	178 vs   221</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit     115 vs   163</p>
<p>Interim dividend 15 pct vs 12.5 pct (per 10-rupee share)</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Glaxo Wellcome Pakistan Ltd. Book closure March 18-24. -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
